{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The esports classic Tower Tag comes home.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOWER TAG</strong> isn't just another VR shooter\u2014it\u2019s a dynamic cyber-sport experience. From over 200 VR arcades worldwide, we bring the intuitive movement and tactical depth directly to your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adrenaline Without the Nausea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to motion sickness. Our intuitive <strong>grappling hook mechanic</strong> makes rapid movement feel completely natural. Swing from tower to tower, maintain your orientation, and focus entirely on the fight. Speed is your ally, and surprise is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187330/extras/9d6313947454cdd4b12b8bc34b8192ac.poster.avif?t=1773426732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187330/extras/9d6313947454cdd4b12b8bc34b8192ac.webm?t=1773426732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187330/extras/9d6313947454cdd4b12b8bc34b8192ac.mp4?t=1773426732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Body is the Controller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kept the controls intentionally simple to maximize immersion. In <strong>TOWER TAG</strong>, you don\u2019t just control a character\u2014you <i>are</i> the character.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Cover:</strong> Use your real-world space! Duck behind towers, lean out for the perfect shot, and dodge enemy lasers with your own body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safe Space:</strong> The game is designed to allow safe and free movement, even in smaller play spaces (&quot;Small Room Scale&quot;).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic &amp; Impactful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up, capture towers, and control the arena. It\u2019s not just about reflexes; it\u2019s about tactical precision.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Control:</strong> Capturing towers grants you cover and opens up new movement routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamplay:</strong> Coordinate with your squad to flank enemies or lure them into traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187330/extras/7162ec87bed4afc330597e2a9a3f90c8.avif?t=1773426732\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features &amp; Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Seamless Multiplayer:</strong> Enjoy <strong>Quick Match and Custom Matches</strong>. Always find a match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Modes for Every Style:</strong> Choose from three intense game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deathmatch:</i> The classic\u2014Free-for-all or Team vs. Team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elimination:</i> Survival of the fittest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Goal Tower:</i> A tactical mode focused on area control and objective capture.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match Variety:</strong> Whether it's intense 1v1 duels, 2v2, 3v3, or chaotic 4v4 battles\u2014anything goes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent Bots:</strong> No players online or just want to train? Practice against adaptive AI opponents that will genuinely challenge you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked Play:</strong> Show the world your skills and climb the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extended Immersion:</strong> Full support for bHaptics vests to let you feel every hit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into our official <strong>Tower Tag Discord</strong> to connect with other players, join tournaments, and share feedback directly with the devs.\u00a0As well as for external match making, feedback, roadmap and support please join our constantly growing &quot;Tower Tag&quot; community on Discord (See on the right side). You'll always find some nice people there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"73a0d9e3fbf11a12e609e52bfe6478d41746e368.jpg","localized_name":"Natural Talent","name":"Natural Talent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1187330/73a0d9e3fbf11a12e609e52bfe6478d41746e368.jpg"},{"icon":"6f6d3d652660f38e3d034510b9f11b19895fdff2.jpg","localized_name":"24/7","name":"24/7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1187330/6f6d3d652660f38e3d034510b9f11b19895fdff2.jpg"},{"icon":"12c451e9e258299f0fd03ee87f8ad00854115b05.jpg","localized_name":"VR-Nerd","name":"VR-Nerd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1187330/12c451e9e258299f0fd03ee87f8ad00854115b05.jpg"},{"icon":"7d3b45960c24712fc11258eed5af22637b466902.jpg","localized_name":"First Strike","name":"First Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1187330/7d3b45960c24712fc11258eed5af22637b466902.jpg"},{"icon":"9f2623d21d5b5f49cec4cc0c3e15b0e1f77a200c.jpg","localized_name":"Lucky Streak","name":"Lucky Streak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1187330/9f2623d21d5b5f49cec4cc0c3e15b0e1f77a200c.jpg"},{"icon":"e5190bf59c28e18c24be970b17a9f0918d1b43e5.jpg","localized_name":"Invincible","name":"Invincible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a